{"created":"2026-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","id":"vx-vxjs0nex","meta":{"title":"VxJSON -- Content Storage Format","description":"VxJSON stores CMS content as git-friendly JSON files with content-last field ordering for 4KB-optimized metadata indexing and deterministic ETags."},"modified":"2026-03-30T00:00:00.000Z","type":"puck","content":{"puckData":{"content":[{"type":"Hero","props":{"id":"Hero-y5z6a7b8","badgeText":"Storage Format","title":"VxJSON","description":"Conloca's git-friendly content storage format. Standard JSON with content-last field ordering for fast metadata indexing and deterministic ETags.","buttons":[]}},{"type":"RichTextSection","props":{"id":"RichTextSection-c9d0e1f2","title":"What is VxJSON?","body":"<p>VxJSON (Variant JSON) is standard JSON with a <span style=\"color: #0f172a; font-weight: 500;\">.vxjson</span> extension and two guarantees: the <span style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: #475569;\">content</span> field is always last, and field order is deterministic. That is it. No special parser needed -- any JSON reader can open a VXJSON file.</p>"}},{"type":"CodeBlock","props":{"id":"CodeBlock-g3h4i5j6","filename":"home.vxjson","code":"<pre style=\"margin:0\"><code style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: #475569;\"><span style=\"color: #94a3b8\">// Metadata -- fits in first 4KB</span>\n<span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"id\"</span>: <span style=\"color: #15803d\">\"abc123\"</span>,\n<span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"type\"</span>: <span style=\"color: #15803d\">\"puck\"</span>,\n<span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"created\"</span>: <span style=\"color: #15803d\">\"2026-01-15T10:00:00Z\"</span>,\n<span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"modified\"</span>: <span style=\"color: #15803d\">\"2026-01-20T14:30:00Z\"</span>,\n<span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"meta\"</span>: {\n  <span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"title\"</span>: <span style=\"color: #15803d\">\"About Us\"</span>,\n  <span style=\"color: #0891b2\">\"description\"</span>: <span style=\"color: #15803d\">\"Learn about our team\"</span>\n},\n\n<span style=\"color: #94a3b8\">// Content payload -- always last</span>\n<span style=\"color: #7e22ce\">\"content\"</span>: {\n  <span style=\"color: #7e22ce\">\"puckData\"</span>: { <span style=\"color: #94a3b8\">...</span> }\n}</code></pre>","accentColor":"","legendItems":[{"id":"legend-1","color":"#06b6d4","label":"Metadata (first 4KB)"},{"id":"legend-2","color":"#a855f7","label":"Content payload"}]}},{"type":"RichTextSection","props":{"id":"RichTextSection-k7l8m9n0","title":"Why Content-Last?","body":"<p>By placing the <span style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: #475569;\">content</span> field last, all metadata fits within the first 4KB of every file. This unlocks two performance advantages.</p>"}},{"type":"FeatureCards","props":{"id":"FeatureCards-o1p2q3r4","label":"","title":"","subtitle":"","columns":"2","cards":[{"id":"card-4k","iconSvgPath":"","title":"4KB Index Reads","description":"The system can index thousands of pages by reading only the first 4KB of each file. Metadata like title, dates, and ETags are always there -- no need to parse the full content payload."},{"id":"card-etag","iconSvgPath":"M7.5 21L3 16.5m0 0L7.5 12M3 16.5h13.5m0-13.5L21 7.5m0 0L16.5 12M21 7.5H7.5","title":"Independent ETags","description":"The dual metaEtag.contentEtag format lets the system detect staleness for metadata and content independently -- critical for content inheritance across locales."}]}},{"type":"RichTextSection","props":{"id":"RichTextSection-s5t6u7v8","title":"Crash-Safe Writes","body":"<p>Every file write in Conloca uses an atomic write strategy. Content is written to a temporary file first, then atomically renamed to the target path. This is a Conloca runtime feature -- independent of the VxJSON format -- ensuring the original file is never corrupted if the process crashes mid-write.</p>"}},{"type":"NumberedFlow","props":{"id":"NumberedFlow-w9x0y1z2","title":"","subtitle":"","items":[{"id":"flow-1","number":"1","title":"Write to temp file","description":"Content is written to a temporary file with a unique name: <code style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: #475569; font-size: 12px;\">{path}.tmp.{pid}.{hrtime}</code>"},{"id":"flow-2","number":"2","title":"Atomic rename","description":"<code style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: #475569; font-size: 12px;\">rename()</code> replaces the target file in a single operation. On POSIX systems, this is guaranteed atomic -- the file is either fully old or fully new."},{"id":"flow-3","number":"3","title":"Crash recovery","description":"If the process crashes during step 1, only the temp file is left behind -- the original is untouched. If it crashes during step 2, the rename either completed or it didn't. No half-written files, ever."}]}},{"type":"RichTextSection","props":{"id":"RichTextSection-a3b4c5d6","title":"ETag Concurrency","body":"<p>Every VXJSON file carries a dual-format ETag that prevents stale overwrites when multiple editors work simultaneously. The format is:</p>"}},{"type":"CodeBlock","props":{"id":"CodeBlock-e7f8g9h0","filename":"","code":"<code style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #0891b2\">metaEtag</span><span style=\"color: #64748b\">.</span><span style=\"color: #7e22ce\">contentEtag</span><span style=\"color: #475569; margin-left: 16px\">// e.g. a3f2c1.b7e4d9</span></code>","accentColor":"","legendItems":[]}},{"type":"RichTextSection","props":{"id":"RichTextSection-i1j2k3l4","title":"","body":"<p>When an editor saves, the CMS sends the expected ETag. If the file was modified since it was loaded, the server rejects the write with a <span style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; color: #475569;\">STALE_WRITE</span> error and presents a conflict resolution dialog. No content is silently overwritten.</p>"}},{"type":"CTABanner","props":{"id":"CTABanner-m5n6o7p8","badgeText":"","title":"See it in action","subtitle":"Get started with Conloca and see how VxJSON keeps your content safe, versioned, and git-friendly.","buttons":[{"id":"btn-vx-1","label":"Get Started","href":"/getting-started/","variant":"primary"},{"id":"btn-vx-2","label":"Back to Home","href":"/","variant":"secondary"}]}}],"root":{"props":{}}}}}
